# Kept out of the build context of the images (plan, phase 11): the dependencies and the build output, which
# the image makes for itself with `npm ci` and `npm run build`, the git history, and the local settings, so
# that nothing built or configured on a laptop reaches an image. `**/` also covers the workspaces, such as
# apps/web/.next.
**/node_modules
**/.next
.git
**/.env
